    "title": "LSUE draws 7-seed; hosts Copiah-Lincoln in Region 23 opener - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By LSU Eunice Athletics ,\n1 days ago EUNICE, La. — LSU Eunice Women’s Basketball is set to host Copiah-Lincoln on Thursday in the first round of the 12-team Region 23 Women’s Basketball Tournament. The Bengals (22-6, 9-0 LCCAC) are the 7-seed in the single elimination field after capturing their second straight LCCAC conference championship. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
